  "label": "User projected onto the sleeping woman as a stereotype",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the sleeping woman (VisualMaterial entity) through the textual projection 'bitches be like..'. The user imagines themselves or others as the 'bitches' who are only attracted to men for money, and the woman in the image is mapped as the embodiment of this stereotype. This projection is implicit, using the visual of the woman sleeping peacefully to contrast with the derogatory text, creating a mocking analogy where the user sees themselves or others as the stereotype being described.",
